 "raw_text": "9/29/26, 9:42 AM\n\n1         12        4\noF\n\nExtrapolation period\n\nApril        May        June\n\nBase period:\n\nJan.    Feb.    Mar.\n\nIf the base period is the same as the previous period, the relevant demand values from the three previous months are used and\n\ntransferred to the extrapolation period.\n\nMeter Reading Organization\n\nPurpose\n\nThis component allows you to define the Street Route for all devices to be read in the service territory and make mass changes to\n\nmeter reading units.\n\nStreet Route\n\nPurpose\n\nYou can use this component to define the sequence in which the devices in a service territory are to be read. Doing this can\n\noptimize the meter reader's route.\n\nThe following criteria are used in defining the street route in a meter reading unit:\n",
